1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 23]

34
00:02:33,590 --> 00:02:34,560
Bad news.

35
00:02:35,190 --> 00:02:36,000
Bad news.

36
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:37,030
Your Highness.

37
00:02:37,310 --> 00:02:38,520
Yun Shao escaped.

38
00:02:39,750 --> 00:02:40,960
Bring her back.

39
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:41,710
Yes.

40
00:02:41,910 --> 00:02:42,520
No need.

41
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,470
I'm here.

42
00:02:50,430 --> 00:02:52,960
Yun Shao, what are you doing?

43
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:55,590
I am Yun Shao.

44
00:02:59,190 --> 00:03:01,470
The late Empress was my mother.

45
00:03:04,310 --> 00:03:05,520
Noble Consort Yun and Han Jin

46
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,310
murdered her

47
00:03:08,190 --> 00:03:09,560
and swapped me
with their son, Gu Qingyan,

48
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,680
sending me out of the city.

49
00:03:11,590 --> 00:03:13,560
Father gave me the Golden Dragon Tally

50
00:03:14,150 --> 00:03:15,280
and charged me to follow Heaven's will,

51
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:16,260
punish the traitors,

52
00:03:16,710 --> 00:03:18,030
restore the court,

53
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:19,360
and set the realm right.

54
00:03:19,870 --> 00:03:22,560
You're lying. Seize her!

55
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,080
Protect the Grand Princess.

56
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,280
Grand Princess?

57
00:03:31,750 --> 00:03:33,960
Yun Shao is the true Grand Princess.

58
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:36,180
Gu Qingyan is the impostor.

59
00:03:44,590 --> 00:03:45,590
Look.

60
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,120
What's happening?

61
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:48,560
It's...

62
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,590
How can this be?

63
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:51,750
This is...

64
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:53,960
You tricked me.

65
00:03:54,590 --> 00:03:56,680
Does she really have royal blood?

66
00:03:57,910 --> 00:03:58,710
Yun Shao.

67
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,470
I told you.

68
00:04:00,470 --> 00:04:01,470
The ritual doesn't matter.

69
00:04:01,870 --> 00:04:03,000
You really think a few words

70
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,310
will make them support you?

71
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,150
Why not ask them

72
00:04:06,470 --> 00:04:08,410
whether they'll obey you?

73
00:04:08,730 --> 00:04:09,360
Guards.

74
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,150
Kill her.

75
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:13,800
Let's go.

76
00:04:16,950 --> 00:04:17,750
Reporting.

77
00:04:19,270 --> 00:04:19,870
Your Highness.

78
00:04:19,870 --> 00:04:21,480
Pei Zhao carries the military tally

79
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,360
and is heading for the west gate

80
00:04:22,570 --> 00:04:23,670
to bring the reinforcements in.

81
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,600
His tally is fake.

82
00:04:26,870 --> 00:04:27,800
He won't make it out alive.

83
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,920
Tell Wei Lin to catch him.

84
00:04:30,310 --> 00:04:30,560
Yes.

85
00:04:37,630 --> 00:04:39,600
Pei Zhao, you colluded with rebels.

86
00:04:40,020 --> 00:04:41,240
You won't get away with this.

87
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:44,000
Want to stop me?

88
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,510
Let's see if you can.

89
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:48,800
The Golden Dragon Tally.

90
00:04:58,630 --> 00:05:00,390
Pei Zhao's tally is fake.

91
00:05:00,870 --> 00:05:01,870
Kill him.

92
00:05:01,870 --> 00:05:03,510
His tally is fake.

93
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:04,870
Whoever takes down Pei Zhao

94
00:05:05,130 --> 00:05:06,390
gets one thousand taels of gold.

95
00:05:06,790 --> 00:05:07,360
Get him.

96
00:05:08,210 --> 00:05:09,610
- Kill.
- Kill.

97
00:05:23,310 --> 00:05:23,920
Yun Shao.

98
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,040
Brother.

99
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,120
Brother.

100
00:05:30,060 --> 00:05:31,240
Lu, where's Lord Pei?

101
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,870
Why didn't he come with you?

102
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,120
He has something else to do.

103
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,630
He sent us ahead to meet you.

104
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:41,840
[Marshal of the Southwest Army]
The Marshal of the Southwest Army.

105
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:43,070
He served under your grandfather.

106
00:05:43,830 --> 00:05:44,950
Greetings, Grand Princess.

107
00:05:44,950 --> 00:05:46,240
Please rise.

108
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:47,800
Let's not talk here.

109
00:05:48,270 --> 00:05:49,120
We should head into the city now.

110
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:52,750
But the palace
and every office in the capital

111
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,430
are now under Gu Qingyan's control.

112
00:05:55,430 --> 00:05:56,390
And he's ordered

113
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:58,120
Lord Pei killed on sight.

114
00:05:58,630 --> 00:06:01,100
Shouldn't we help Lord Pei first?

115
00:06:01,450 --> 00:06:03,930
He's not as strong as he used to be.

116
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,480
What do you mean?

117
00:06:06,870 --> 00:06:07,950
What did he do?

118
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:09,560
He

119
00:06:10,430 --> 00:06:11,870
took the child Gu into his own body.

120
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:15,160
Lord Pei.

121
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:22,270
And then?

122
00:06:22,270 --> 00:06:23,160
What will happen to him?

123
00:06:24,630 --> 00:06:25,430
Agony day and night,

124
00:06:25,780 --> 00:06:26,440
until death.

125
00:06:31,270 --> 00:06:32,510
Why would he do that?

126
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:35,720
Lu.

127
00:06:36,310 --> 00:06:37,550
You said
as long as the child Gu is safe,

128
00:06:37,550 --> 00:06:38,570
the mother Gu would be fine.

129
00:06:40,630 --> 00:06:41,830
He was badly wounded
by the blood-jade ruler.

130
00:06:42,830 --> 00:06:43,600
The mother Gu went wild

131
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:44,910
and the poison spread.

132
00:06:46,610 --> 00:06:47,270
If the mother Gu dies,

133
00:06:48,270 --> 00:06:49,070
the child Gu dies too.

134
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:51,540
Where is he now?

135
00:06:53,070 --> 00:06:54,070
He used himself as bait

136
00:06:54,830 --> 00:06:56,070
to lure Gu Qingyan to the west gate.

137
00:06:57,070 --> 00:06:58,390
We'll open the east gate

138
00:06:58,800 --> 00:06:59,720
and let the reinforcements in

139
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,510
to escort the Grand Princess
to the palace.

140
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:02,950
How many men did he take?

141
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,070
Eleven Fengyi Guards.

142
00:07:10,820 --> 00:07:12,520
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

143
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:14,330
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

144
00:07:14,340 --> 00:07:15,990
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

145
00:07:15,990 --> 00:07:18,520
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

146
00:07:18,530 --> 00:07:19,760
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

147
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:21,510
Don't fear him.

148
00:07:22,630 --> 00:07:23,720
The mother-child Gu has

149
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:24,830
drained his strength.

150
00:07:24,830 --> 00:07:25,720
He won't last long.

151
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:26,830
Get him.

152
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:29,340
♪The wandering road goes on♪

153
00:07:29,350 --> 00:07:31,780
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

154
00:07:31,790 --> 00:07:33,100
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

155
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:35,290
♪A thousand tears fall♪

156
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:38,790
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

157
00:07:38,910 --> 00:07:42,060
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

158
00:07:42,220 --> 00:07:44,100
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

159
00:07:44,100 --> 00:07:45,580
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

160
00:07:45,590 --> 00:07:48,100
♪The years have left their scars♪

161
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:48,820
Get on.

162
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:52,040
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

163
00:07:52,090 --> 00:07:52,720
Hold on tight.

164
00:07:53,190 --> 00:07:53,960
Hyah.

165
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:57,580
♪My heart lies broken♪

166
00:07:57,590 --> 00:08:03,290
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

167
00:08:04,950 --> 00:08:05,750
Sir.

168
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,360
Put him here.

169
00:08:10,390 --> 00:08:10,890
Pei Zhao.

170
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:12,400
Pei Zhao, don't sleep.

171
00:08:12,830 --> 00:08:13,410
Don't sleep.

172
00:08:15,310 --> 00:08:15,850
Pei Zhao.

173
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,630
It was too chaotic.

174
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:26,680
Trying to kill Pei Zhao
would've put Yun Shao at risk.

175
00:08:26,910 --> 00:08:28,630
We had no choice
but to let her take him.

176
00:08:31,660 --> 00:08:32,240
Forgive me, Your Highness.

177
00:08:33,900 --> 00:08:35,200
Yun Shao's been lying to you all along.

178
00:08:35,790 --> 00:08:37,630
Even sending the tally was an act.

179
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:49,630
Anyone not of one mind with me

180
00:08:49,630 --> 00:08:50,390
dies.

181
00:08:54,770 --> 00:08:55,530
Your Highness.

182
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:57,440
Leave.

183
00:08:59,260 --> 00:08:59,670
Yes.

184
00:09:02,030 --> 00:09:03,600
Han Jin is dead.

185
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:06,690
Was using me

186
00:09:07,270 --> 00:09:09,840
to kill your own father not enough?

187
00:09:11,750 --> 00:09:13,270
Now you want

188
00:09:14,390 --> 00:09:15,510
your own brother dead too?

189
00:09:15,510 --> 00:09:17,840
Had I not killed him, would he spare me?

190
00:09:19,790 --> 00:09:21,150
You're not young anymore.

191
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,320
Don't be so naive.

192
00:09:24,790 --> 00:09:25,990
You monster.

193
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:28,670
Think before you slap me.

194
00:09:29,550 --> 00:09:31,440
I'm all you have left now.

195
00:09:40,270 --> 00:09:41,440
How did it come to this?

196
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:45,440
Qingyan.

197
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,390
Please, I'm begging you.

198
00:09:47,790 --> 00:09:49,120
Spare your brother.

199
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,270
Please.

200
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,910
I'd like to spare him.

201
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,550
Do you think he'll survive?

202
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:59,120
He has the mother-child Gu.

203
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,600
There's no cure.

204
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:01,910
Nothing can save him.

205
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:04,840
Do you know what he looks like now?

206
00:10:05,790 --> 00:10:07,440
Like a ghost.

207
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:05,240
Ruoli told me everything.

208
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:08,000
I know you're awake.

209
00:11:12,870 --> 00:11:13,440
Don't look at me.

210
00:11:14,270 --> 00:11:14,720
Why?

211
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:16,870
I look awful.

212
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,360
And you lied to me every day.

213
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,870
What did I lie about?

214
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,440
You always made me praise you.

215
00:11:24,790 --> 00:11:25,870
Called you handsome,

216
00:11:25,870 --> 00:11:26,750
brave,

217
00:11:26,750 --> 00:11:27,910
wise.

218
00:11:27,910 --> 00:11:28,910
You liar.

219
00:11:47,450 --> 00:11:50,350
♪Moonlight sways, flowers scent the air♪

220
00:11:50,740 --> 00:11:53,860
♪Who is singing softly in my heart?♪

221
00:11:54,310 --> 00:12:00,200
♪Your burning gaze strips my guard away♪

222
00:12:01,050 --> 00:12:04,320
♪Fengyi blades lie hidden in the dark♪

223
00:12:04,610 --> 00:12:07,890
♪For one moment, all is lost to love♪

224
00:12:08,410 --> 00:12:15,210
♪Your blade stands shielding by my side♪

225
00:12:18,050 --> 00:12:24,910
♪The crescent moon binds me
to memories past♪

226
00:12:25,140 --> 00:12:29,190
♪Endless bonds,
a mountain we cannot pass♪

227
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:30,670
Maybe a little.

228
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,080
But it's okay.

229
00:12:33,910 --> 00:12:35,150
I'll find the cure

230
00:12:36,510 --> 00:12:37,270
and heal you.

231
00:12:38,820 --> 00:12:45,420
♪We shared the storm,
yet cannot cut the ties♪

232
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:47,670
You'll still

233
00:12:48,910 --> 00:12:50,440
be as handsome as ever.

234
00:12:59,460 --> 00:13:02,510
♪Moonlight sways, flowers scent the air♪

235
00:13:02,750 --> 00:13:06,000
♪Who is singing softly in my heart?♪

236
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:12,640
♪Your burning gaze strips my guard away♪

237
00:13:13,110 --> 00:13:14,450
♪Fengyi blades...♪

238
00:13:17,670 --> 00:13:18,200
Lu.

239
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:18,960
Have someone watch him.

240
00:13:19,670 --> 00:13:20,440
Ruoming.

241
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:21,030
Ruoli.

242
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:22,840
Take your men through the secret tunnel.

243
00:13:23,270 --> 00:13:24,120
By tomorrow night,

244
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,080
you must take the city gate.

245
00:13:25,870 --> 00:13:26,390
- Okay.
- Okay.

246
00:13:26,870 --> 00:13:27,150
Go.

247
00:13:27,270 --> 00:13:27,750
- Be careful.
- Go.

248
00:13:30,180 --> 00:13:33,180
[Wangyue Gate]

249
00:13:34,270 --> 00:13:34,750
Your Highness.

250
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:35,910
What now?

251
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:39,910
Bring Father.

252
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,200
Has your brother come?

253
00:13:53,630 --> 00:13:56,200
You really do love my brother.

254
00:13:56,910 --> 00:13:57,910
Still thinking of him now.

255
00:13:58,840 --> 00:13:59,480
Don't worry.

256
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:01,000
Yun Shao is here.

257
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:01,870
He'll surely come.

258
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:04,960
Yun Shao is the one who should die.

259
00:14:05,870 --> 00:14:07,000
Without her,

260
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:08,510
none of this would've happened.

261
00:14:09,390 --> 00:14:10,440
I should've

262
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,870
strangled that curse myself.

263
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:12,870
She's mine.

264
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:15,480
Whether she lives or dies is my choice.

265
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:18,000
If you interfere again,

266
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:20,080
don't blame me for what I do.

267
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,910
I'm your mother.

268
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:24,510
Why are you treating me like this?

269
00:14:24,910 --> 00:14:26,200
You chose this yourself.

270
00:14:26,870 --> 00:14:28,720
You loved my brother and neglected me.

271
00:14:29,270 --> 00:14:30,510
So this is what you get.

272
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:31,720
Guards.

273
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:33,600
Take the Noble Consort away.

274
00:14:34,150 --> 00:14:35,270
Qingyan, please.

275
00:14:35,270 --> 00:14:36,440
Spare your brother.

276
00:14:36,790 --> 00:14:37,870
I'm begging you.

277
00:14:38,860 --> 00:14:39,480
Qingyan.

278
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:43,550
Your Highness.

279
00:14:45,270 --> 00:14:45,790
Your Highness.

280
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:49,510
Your Highness.

281
00:14:51,510 --> 00:14:52,510
I've brought His Majesty.

282
00:14:55,630 --> 00:14:56,360
Father.

283
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,030
Someone is rebelling.

284
00:14:58,510 --> 00:14:59,320
I ask

285
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:00,440
that you witness this yourself.

286
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,270
Watch me

287
00:15:02,750 --> 00:15:05,080
crush the rebels

288
00:15:05,550 --> 00:15:08,120
and leave them nowhere to be buried.

289
00:15:08,750 --> 00:15:09,320
You...

290
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:09,920
Your Majesty.

291
00:15:10,270 --> 00:15:11,080
You...

292
00:15:41,630 --> 00:15:42,750
Charge!

293
00:16:05,390 --> 00:16:06,200
Your Highness.

294
00:16:06,670 --> 00:16:07,440
They're breaking through.

295
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:08,670
We should retreat.

296
00:16:08,670 --> 00:16:09,600
No one retreats.

297
00:16:10,550 --> 00:16:12,150
They're all traitors.

298
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:14,320
I'll make sure none leave alive.

299
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:42,600
Their attack is too strong.

300
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:44,630
We should fall back for now.

301
00:16:44,630 --> 00:16:45,030
Your Highness.

302
00:16:48,870 --> 00:16:49,360
Your Highness.

303
00:16:51,390 --> 00:16:51,910
Your Highness.

304
00:16:53,750 --> 00:16:54,320
Your Highness.

305
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:55,910
Retreat.

306
00:16:57,150 --> 00:16:59,240
Take Mother Consort and Father.

307
00:17:02,210 --> 00:17:02,670
Yes.

308
00:17:09,310 --> 00:17:09,880
Your Majesty.

309
00:17:11,070 --> 00:17:11,510
Your Majesty.

310
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:12,820
Your Majesty.

311
00:17:13,750 --> 00:17:14,270
Your Majesty.

312
00:17:22,110 --> 00:17:22,610
His Majesty

313
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:25,940
has passed away.

314
00:17:40,830 --> 00:17:41,960
Qingyan, what's wrong?

315
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:43,350
You look pale.

316
00:17:46,110 --> 00:17:47,030
Gu Qingyan, stop.

317
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:49,790
Shao.

318
00:17:50,310 --> 00:17:50,920
You're here.

319
00:17:51,030 --> 00:17:51,880
Where's my father?

320
00:17:52,510 --> 00:17:53,200
Come with me.

321
00:17:53,720 --> 00:17:54,920
I'll take you to him.

322
00:17:55,270 --> 00:17:56,510
Qingyan, save it.

323
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:57,510
Wei Lin.

324
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:58,880
Seize her.

325
00:18:00,750 --> 00:18:01,440
Why are you here?

326
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:03,720
Wherever you are,

327
00:18:04,400 --> 00:18:05,000
there shall I be.

328
00:18:07,310 --> 00:18:08,000
Pei Zhao.

329
00:18:08,590 --> 00:18:09,790
You really came.

330
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:14,350
Wei Lin.

331
00:18:15,070 --> 00:18:15,920
Take Mother Consort away.

332
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:17,240
No one comes near.

333
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:18,110
Yes.

334
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:19,640
Qingyan, what are you doing?

335
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:20,790
Qingyan.

336
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:22,440
Lu Li.

337
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:24,270
Protect the Grand Princess.

338
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:26,790
Pei Zhao.

339
00:18:55,840 --> 00:18:58,650
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

340
00:19:00,270 --> 00:19:03,460
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

341
00:19:04,780 --> 00:19:06,520
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

342
00:19:07,020 --> 00:19:11,460
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

343
00:19:13,620 --> 00:19:16,290
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

344
00:19:17,510 --> 00:19:22,520
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

345
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:30,870
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

346
00:19:31,140 --> 00:19:39,760
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

347
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:48,430
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

348
00:19:48,810 --> 00:19:57,680
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

349
00:19:58,110 --> 00:20:06,600
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
